libsecp256k1 is an optimized C library for elliptic curve operations
on the curve secp256k1: key generation, ECDSA signatures and their
verification, public key recovery, ECDH, and the x-only public keys
of the extrakeys module.

This package builds the static archive and the shared library,
with the modules ecdh, recovery and extrakeys. It installs the
headers and the pkg-config file.
